	measure 'AI Churn Decision' = "Do not gate launches on this score. Monitor CPA and CTR in week 1 of every campaign and pause any that trend below the ROI threshold. The old 99.98% churn label was removed because it leaked into the features."
		displayFolder: _AI Insights
